    <groupId>melons.innocent.math</groupId>
    <artifactId>math-curves</artifactId>
    <packaging>jar</packaging>

    <description>
        Curves worked out: each a value of its own, its components what it is given, its start and its end among them,
        giving one value for each x from its start to its end, the same every time, and saying which kind of curve
        it is (math-existences). In real units, never stretched to a share: a circle stays a circle.
    </description>

